<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Cera eyeing Internet share trading.</title>
<headline>Belgian Cera eyeing Internet share trading.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Cera Bank, which entered the Internet banking fray last month, said on Thursday it was also considering on-line share trading using the Internet.</p>
<p>&quot;We have an idea about the transactions we would like to carry out...and bourse orders are among (those) being considered. They are certainly on the list,&quot; Cera Chief Executive Officer Willy Breesch told a news conference on 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
